+   * gets a chance to build/group it. Removing the notification block for chat
+   * messages turns them into data messages; FCM then always calls
+   * [onMessageReceived], expo-notifications builds the notification, and the
+   * native grouping code in `PlanitChatNotification` can run in every app
+   * state.
+   *
+   * This is scoped to chat messages from the Expo push service and is skipped
+   * while the app is in the foreground (the normal foreground pipeline already
+   * groups correctly). Task and other notification types keep the stock FCM
+   * behavior.
